description:
Develop a circuit that counts the number of set bits (1s) in a 16-bit input. The module takes a 16-bit binary number as input and produces a 4-bit output representing the total count of bits set to 1. The count is calculated using a loop that iterates through each bit of the input, incrementing the count for each set bit detected.
