Design a clock-driven pacemaker circuit that generates a one-clock-cycle pulse every 6250000 clock cycles. The output 'out' toggles to HIGH for one clock cycle when the count reaches 6250000 and remains LOW for the rest of the clock cycles. This allows for the generation of periodic signals suitable for applications like pacing in rhythm control scenarios.
module top_module(
    input clk,
    output reg out
    );

