Design a 2-to-4 line decoder. The module takes a 2-bit input and activates one of the four outputs based on the input value, ensuring that only the corresponding output becomes HIGH while the others remain LOW. The decoder's functionality is essential for applications such as address decoding in memory systems or facilitating selection in digital circuits.
