Design a circuit that detects sustained button presses at a 10 Hz clock frequency. When the button (pb) is held down for at least 2 seconds (20 clock cycles), it sets the output (isKP) to HIGH, indicating that the button is being pressed. If the button is released (pb = 0), the count resets, and the output indicates no button press (isKP = 0).
module top_module(
    input clk10hz,
    input pb,
    output reg isKP
);

